---
import Layout from "~/layouts/Layout.astro";
import PageHeader from "~/components/PageHeader.astro";
import Section from "~/components/Section.astro";
import CoverageMap from "~/components/CoverageMap.astro";
import CtaBand from "~/components/CtaBand.astro";
import { localBusiness, breadcrumbs } from "~/lib/structured-data";
import { countiesServed } from "~/lib/areas";

const jsonLd = [
 localBusiness(),
 breadcrumbs([
 { name: "Home", path: "/" },
 { name: "Service Areas", path: "/service-areas" },
 ]),
];
---

<Layout
 title="Service Areas in the FL Panhandle | Faith Lawn Care"
 description="Serving Marianna, Cottondale, Graceville, Sneads, Blountstown, Bristol, and Chipley. See our interactive coverage map of the Florida Panhandle."
 path="/service-areas"
 jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
 <PageHeader eyebrow="Where we work" title="Service Areas">
 We are based in Marianna and cover {countiesServed.length} counties across the
 Panhandle. Hover or tap any town on the map to see how far out it is and what
 kind of scheduling to expect.
 </PageHeader>

 <Section>
 <CoverageMap />
 </Section>

 <Section band size="sm">
 <div class="max-w-3xl" data-reveal>
 <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-ink">
 How the tiers actually work
 </h2>
 <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
 <p>
 The difference between tiers is scheduling, not quality or price. A
 lawn in Bristol gets the same crew and the same standard as one in
 Marianna — it just runs on a set day rather than any day.
 </p>
 <p>
 Jackson County is home. We are somewhere in the county most days, so we
 can usually work an urgent job in quickly and there is no travel charge
 or minimum property size.
 </p>
 <p>
 Calhoun and Liberty run on grouped routes. If you want regular mowing
 out there, say so early and we will put you on the rotation rather than
 fitting you in around it.
 </p>
 <p>
 Past that, out to roughly two hours, we take the jobs that justify the
 drive: cleanouts, hauls, tree work, and full property cleanups. Call
 and describe it — we will tell you honestly whether it makes sense for
 us to come, rather than quoting a number we cannot stand behind.
 </p>
 </div>
 </div>
 </Section>

 <CtaBand
 title="Not sure if you're in range?"
 body="Call and ask. It takes thirty seconds and we will give you a straight yes or no."
 />
</Layout>
